# South Africa SDR

> Outsourced South African SDR teams for US, UK, AU and EU B2B companies. Cape Town-based, English-first, GMT+2 overlap. A LeadMaker company.

South Africa SDR builds dedicated outbound sales teams for Western markets. Reps prospect, qualify, and book meetings while working your hours and tools. Typical cost savings are 55–65% versus a Western in-house hire.

## Services

- [Services overview](https://southafricasdr.com/services/): Hub for outsourced SDR, appointment setting, customer service, and technical support from South Africa.
- [SDR services](https://southafricasdr.com/services/sdr/): Dedicated South African sales development reps for outbound prospecting, qualification, and pipeline generation.
- [Appointment setting](https://southafricasdr.com/services/appointment-setting/): Focused meeting-booking teams for B2B sales cycles with scripted outreach and calendar handoff.
- [Customer service](https://southafricasdr.com/services/customer-service/): English-first support reps for client retention, onboarding, and tier-1 customer operations.
- [Technical support](https://southafricasdr.com/services/technical-support/): Product and IT support reps trained on your stack, tickets, and escalation paths.

